	(descr "GY-PCM5102 (PCM5102A) I2S DAC module, plugged in on female headers: 6-pin I2S row (SCK BCK DIN LCK GND VIN) and the AGND ROUT AGND LROUT end of the 9-pin row (as I2S_DAC1/J4 on PicoGUS v1.2). Courtyard only around the pins: the module sits ~11 mm above the card, over low parts.")
